WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:09.190
Holy Principality of Belluga

00:00.000 --> 00:09.190
Tearmoon Empire

00:01.010 --> 00:06.100
<i>The Holy Principality of Belluga is 
headquarters of the Central Orthodox Church,</i>

00:06.100 --> 00:09.980
<i>the leader of a faith long practiced 
by the people of the continent,</i>

00:09.980 --> 00:17.230
<i>and a hyper-elite school for young royals 
and nobility: the Saint Noel Academy.</i>

01:50.750 --> 01:55.670
<b>Episode 3: Princess Mia Sows Seeds</b>

01:58.740 --> 02:00.550
Look, Princess Mia!

02:00.950 --> 02:05.140
I can't believe they have such 
wonderful shops right by the academy!

02:05.430 --> 02:07.100
Quite right.

02:13.040 --> 02:15.670
<i>This is what I've been preparing for.</i>

02:15.670 --> 02:19.740
<i>There are two rules I must 
follow at the academy.</i>

02:19.740 --> 02:24.400
<i>First, stay away from high-risk individuals that may lead to the guillotine.</i>

02:24.400 --> 02:26.830
<i>Yes, far away from those two...</i>

02:27.250 --> 02:29.630
<i>Sion Sol Sunkland,</i>

02:29.630 --> 02:31.890
<i>First Prince of the Kingdom of Sunkland,</i>

02:31.890 --> 02:34.720
<i>a major power on par with 
the Tearmoon Empire.</i>

02:34.720 --> 02:37.590
<i>With his dashing looks,
 strong sense of justice,</i>

02:37.590 --> 02:41.550
<i>academic excellence, and martial prowess,</i>

02:41.930 --> 02:47.140
<i>he was perfect. The object of all the 
girls' adoration. Mia included, of course.</i>

02:55.270 --> 02:58.490
<i>There, now come speak to me, Prince Sion.</i>

02:58.920 --> 03:04.260
<i>I, Imperial Princess of the Tearmoon Empire, 
am the only appropriate match for you.</i>

03:06.960 --> 03:07.940
Tiona!

03:10.390 --> 03:12.790
<i></i>Her?!<i> How dare she!</i>

03:13.150 --> 03:16.340
<i>Tiona Rudolvon, daughter 
of a lower noble family</i>

03:16.340 --> 03:20.260
<i>holding territory in the southern 
outskirts of the Tearmoon Empire.</i>

03:20.260 --> 03:23.340
<i>Who does she think she is to disregard me?!</i>

03:26.180 --> 03:28.520
<i>Mia bullied her.</i>

03:28.520 --> 03:32.370
<i>That harassment became 
a driving force for Tiona</i>

03:32.370 --> 03:35.830
<i>to become a voice for the populace's 
anger and a leader of the revolution,</i>

03:35.830 --> 03:38.070
<i>and Sion served as her ally.</i>

03:38.070 --> 03:40.190
<i>The outcome for Mia was...</i>

03:40.490 --> 03:40.950
Hey!

03:42.850 --> 03:46.110
<i>What foolish choices I made.</i>

03:46.110 --> 03:48.640
<i>I reaped what I sowed.</i>

03:48.640 --> 03:52.150
<i>The actions you take all come back to you.</i>

03:52.150 --> 03:55.100
<i>But that was in the previous timeline.</i>

03:55.100 --> 03:57.780
<i>This time, I shall have absolutely 
nothing to do with them!</i>

03:58.530 --> 04:00.320
Princess Mia, look there...

04:01.470 --> 04:02.940
Oh, my. What's going on?

04:02.940 --> 04:04.010
What's happening there?

04:04.010 --> 04:05.640
What's with that look?

04:05.860 --> 04:08.010
<i>Ugh, Tiona!</i>

04:09.300 --> 04:11.440
What shall we do, Princess Mia?

04:11.440 --> 04:12.230
Huh?

04:12.490 --> 04:15.740
<i>Princess Mia would never 
abandon a person in need!</i>

04:15.740 --> 04:18.060
<i>How will you help them, Princess Mia?!</i>

04:18.060 --> 04:20.990
Uh, I...

04:21.440 --> 04:24.580
<i>Mia was caught between
a rock and a hard place.</i>

04:24.580 --> 04:30.200
<i>Should she help her bitter enemy or
 lose the trust of her most loyal retainer?</i>

04:30.500 --> 04:32.860
A servant's affront is the 
master's responsibility.

04:32.860 --> 04:34.920
Exactly so.

04:35.300 --> 04:40.700
So it's the same here, too. The rot in
the nobility continues unabated.

04:40.700 --> 04:44.380
What's your move? Help them?
Though It may be a pain.

04:45.090 --> 04:46.340
Of course.

04:46.650 --> 04:50.100
Now, apologize this instant!

04:50.100 --> 04:52.020
Yes, I'm waiting.

04:52.280 --> 04:53.350
Hold it!

04:53.680 --> 04:55.390
You three.

04:55.750 --> 04:57.740
What is the meaning of this?

04:59.200 --> 05:02.540
Excuse me? Who are you to interject?

05:02.540 --> 05:04.650
Y-Your Highness Princess Mia?

05:04.650 --> 05:07.320
P-Princess Mia? You don't mean...

05:08.420 --> 05:12.790
First Imperial Princess of the 
Tearmoon Empire, Mia Luna Tearmoon.

05:13.110 --> 05:15.560
Pleased to make your acquaintance.

05:17.240 --> 05:18.080
Now, then...

05:19.660 --> 05:20.860
You three.

05:20.860 --> 05:23.290
Tell me. What is the meaning of this?

05:23.290 --> 05:29.010
<i>To make me throw a lifeline to my enemy...
There's no sentence heavy enough.</i>

05:29.010 --> 05:33.810
It appeared that you were being rude 
to one of my imperial subjects.

05:33.810 --> 05:38.360
N-No, it was just that Her Ladyship is an 
outland noble, ignorant of high society—

05:38.360 --> 05:40.270
Did you not hear me?

05:40.270 --> 05:44.820
My favor extends universally 
to all of my subjects.

05:45.050 --> 05:49.030
Including those who are 
poor and of lower station.

05:49.780 --> 05:56.330
If I see <i>any</i> imperial subject being 
treated poorly, I shan't overlook it!

06:00.010 --> 06:04.470
<i>There. I helped you out, so you 
can't complain about what I said.</i>

06:04.470 --> 06:08.440
<i>To translate: "I'm not saying 
you're special, Tiona."</i>

06:08.440 --> 06:11.970
<i>"I'm putting you at the bottom 
of the hierarchy. Take that!"</i>

06:11.970 --> 06:13.970
<i>That is Mia's take on the situation, but...</i>

06:14.890 --> 06:18.000
<i>I and everyone in House Rudolvon</i>

06:18.000 --> 06:21.190
<i>were always treated as outsiders
rather than subjects.</i>

06:21.840 --> 06:28.320
<i>To prove our worth, I pushed myself
endlessly and enrolled at Saint Noel Academy.</i>

06:28.320 --> 06:31.860
<i>And yet I've endured torment 
from the very first day.</i>

06:35.180 --> 06:38.080
<i>Sh-She's crying?! D-Did I go too far?</i>

06:38.540 --> 06:42.540
Oh, um, erm, t-take this to dry your tears!

06:43.410 --> 06:44.500
Princess Mia!

06:45.070 --> 06:47.090
<i>But she didn't...</i>

06:47.510 --> 06:50.380
<i>She recognized me as an imperial subject.</i>

06:51.180 --> 06:58.080
<i>She said even someone powerless and 
unimportant has her favor and protection.</i>

06:59.690 --> 07:04.340
Lady Tiona, don't cry. Are you still sad?

07:04.340 --> 07:07.990
Far from it. These are not tears of sadness.

07:08.600 --> 07:12.810
These are tears of joy at 
this miraculous encounter.

07:16.210 --> 07:19.920
So that was Princess Mia, the one 
celebrated as the "Wisdom of the Empire."

07:19.920 --> 07:24.750
I've heard she arranged for the 
construction of a hospital in the slums.

07:25.020 --> 07:25.660
Yes.

07:26.220 --> 07:29.880
<i>I had assumed she was either a sheltered
girl who didn't get the value of things</i>

07:29.880 --> 07:34.600
<i>or a bleeding heart who had
compassion and nothing else.</i>

07:35.080 --> 07:39.630
<i>But to inject oneself into 
a quarrel and rebuff evil</i>

07:39.630 --> 07:41.890
<i>is not something a mere
bleeding heart could do.</i>

07:42.380 --> 07:48.610
<i>The qualities befitting one of imperial 
lineage unmistakably reside within her.</i>

07:51.340 --> 07:58.540
<i>Thus it was that Mia firmly involved herself 
with the two people she swore not to.</i>

08:02.640 --> 08:06.260
I just spotted the imperial 
princess of the Tearmoon Empire.

08:06.260 --> 08:08.740
The one people are calling 
the "Wisdom of the Empire"?

08:08.740 --> 08:13.390
Yes! Princess Mia! And she
looked every bit a lovely princess.

08:28.950 --> 08:33.700
Ah, it's as if the day's weariness 
is being rinsed off as well.

08:33.700 --> 08:37.400
<i>I wish I could rinse that 
incident earlier away, too.</i>

08:39.600 --> 08:43.580
I must say, the baths 
here are truly wonderful.

08:44.000 --> 08:47.240
You really love baths, 
don't you, Princess Mia?

08:47.240 --> 08:49.290
Yes, I adore them.

08:49.660 --> 08:56.770
<i>After all, I used to have to make do with 
just a pail of cold water each week.</i>

08:59.360 --> 09:04.490
<i>Her skin is positively pearly, and her 
hair is silky smooth and beautiful...</i>

09:05.440 --> 09:07.790
<i>The effects of her daily 
care are shining through.</i>

09:07.790 --> 09:10.220
<i>It's like she's a goddess of the moon.</i>

09:11.420 --> 09:14.160
There. All finished, Princess Mia.

09:14.160 --> 09:16.490
You always do such a good job, Anne.

09:16.920 --> 09:22.200
I know! From time to time, 
I shall scrub <i>your</i> back for you!

09:22.200 --> 09:25.410
What? I-I-I could never ask you to do that!

09:25.780 --> 09:30.290
Come. Just sit down and relax. 
I know you must be tired, too.

09:30.290 --> 09:33.120
I shall scrub you until 
you're all soft and smooth.

09:36.190 --> 09:40.280
U-Um, Princess Mia. Thank you.

09:40.280 --> 09:41.380
Anne...

09:42.080 --> 09:45.020
<i>That's what I should be saying to you.</i>

09:45.440 --> 09:49.980
<i>You visited me and were there 
for me right up to my death.</i>

09:50.440 --> 09:54.380
<i>Little by little, I shall repay 
that debt this time around.</i>

09:55.600 --> 09:57.280
There. All finished.

09:57.690 --> 09:59.320
Now we're ready to soak.

09:59.840 --> 10:01.780
I see you two are quite close.

10:05.000 --> 10:06.960
Y-You're...

10:07.400 --> 10:11.860
<i>Rafina Orca Belluga, eldest daughter 
of Orleans, Duke of Belluga,</i>

10:11.860 --> 10:16.420
<i>ruler of the Holy Principality of Belluga, 
where Saint Noel Academy is located.</i>

10:16.850 --> 10:19.600
<i>Rafina was serving as 
student council president.</i>

10:19.600 --> 10:26.890
<i>In the previous timeline, Mia was drawn 
to Rafina's authority and approached her.</i>

10:27.340 --> 10:30.920
Princess Rafina, I hope you have been well.

10:33.540 --> 10:38.320
Pardon me, but are we acquainted?

10:40.420 --> 10:42.990
<i>Though she made a variety of efforts,</i>

10:43.360 --> 10:46.950
<i>she failed to form a friendship with Rafina,</i>

10:46.950 --> 10:52.410
<i>In fact, she began to be regarded with the 
sort of look reserved for something worthless.</i>

10:53.620 --> 10:56.190
<i>To see her here of all places...</i>

10:56.190 --> 10:59.520
A pleasure to make your 
acquaintance, Princess Rafina.

10:59.520 --> 11:00.720
I am...

11:01.280 --> 11:04.170
Imperial Princess Mia Luna Tearmoon.

11:04.170 --> 11:06.080
I am delighted to meet you.

11:06.080 --> 11:07.560
Your reputation precedes you.

11:09.850 --> 11:13.940
<i>H-How come she knows my name?</i>

11:13.940 --> 11:16.230
<i>It's actually not a pleasure.</i>

11:17.880 --> 11:21.540
If you just stand there, you'll catch cold.

11:21.540 --> 11:23.970
Let us enjoy the bath together.

11:23.970 --> 11:26.450
I-I shall do just that.

11:26.720 --> 11:28.320
<i>A-Anne...</i>

11:28.320 --> 11:32.490
<i>We very well can't share the same 
bath in front of Princess Rafina.</i>

11:32.490 --> 11:35.040
<i>But if I send Anne away...</i>

11:35.040 --> 11:37.840
<i>I'll be alone with Rafina.</i>

11:37.840 --> 11:39.460
<i>Th-There's no way! I can't!</i>

11:39.460 --> 11:43.010
<i>I can't face such a frightful situation!</i>

11:43.440 --> 11:45.600
Please join us as well, Miss Maid.

11:47.690 --> 11:52.600
In this space, we are stripped of the 
trappings of royalty, nobility, or subject.

11:52.600 --> 11:54.810
We are simply three people.

11:55.330 --> 11:58.270
You feel the same way, 
don't you, Princess Mia?

11:58.270 --> 12:00.900
Indeed. Quite so!

12:02.080 --> 12:05.430
Anne! You heard Princess Rafina.

12:05.430 --> 12:07.390
Come right here next to me!

12:07.390 --> 12:08.620
B-But...

12:08.620 --> 12:10.020
Don't be shy!

12:10.020 --> 12:11.540
O-O-Okay.

12:17.140 --> 12:19.820
You can't warm up as nicely over there.

12:19.820 --> 12:21.510
Come over here, near me.

12:21.780 --> 12:23.990
D-Don't worry. I'm fine over here!

12:23.990 --> 12:26.730
Don't be shy! Come on!

12:26.730 --> 12:27.470
Princess Mia!

12:27.470 --> 12:29.010
Come with me!

12:29.010 --> 12:31.520
You two really are quite close, aren't you?

12:32.180 --> 12:36.400
Of course. Anne is my confidante.

12:37.490 --> 12:38.980
Confidante?

12:38.980 --> 12:43.230
<i>Which is why, if things go south,
 it'll be two against one.</i>

12:39.820 --> 12:48.700
<b>Confidante</b>

12:39.820 --> 12:48.700
<b>Mia</b>

12:39.820 --> 12:48.700
<b>Rafina</b>

12:39.820 --> 12:48.700
<b>2 vs. 1</b>

12:43.230 --> 12:48.700
<i>No matter how much sway you may hold,
 my confidante won't betray me.</i>

12:50.160 --> 12:52.560
Whatever is the matter, Anne?

12:52.560 --> 12:55.120
I b-beg your pardon.

12:55.430 --> 12:56.910
I see.

12:56.910 --> 13:01.170
It would appear you live up to your 
name as the "Wisdom of the Empire."

13:02.910 --> 13:04.420
By the way, Princess Mia...

13:04.880 --> 13:08.720
Would you be aware of the
 welcoming party two days from now?

13:08.720 --> 13:11.910
A welcoming party? Hm...

13:11.910 --> 13:15.610
A ball to welcome the incoming students.

13:15.610 --> 13:17.530
Perhaps you haven't heard.

13:17.530 --> 13:22.610
I was convinced you must have 
already been invited to dance.

13:22.990 --> 13:25.030
A dance... A dance...

13:25.340 --> 13:26.400
A dance—

13:27.460 --> 13:28.800
<i>That's right!</i>

13:28.800 --> 13:33.950
<i>I had completely erased that 
infuriating incident from my memory!</i>

13:33.950 --> 13:35.330
<i>As alluded to earlier,</i>

13:35.650 --> 13:41.800
<i>in the previous timeline, Mia was convinced 
that Prince Sion would go out with her.</i>

13:42.240 --> 13:48.010
<i>Naturally, she fully believed a 
dance invitation was coming her way.</i>

13:48.010 --> 13:52.510
<i>Here, Prince Sion. I await 
your invitation to dance!</i>

13:55.350 --> 13:56.300
Tiona!

13:57.760 --> 14:00.490
Might I have the honor of a dance with you?

14:01.990 --> 14:07.450
<i>Thus, Mia wound up in the nightmare 
of attending the party solo.</i>

14:07.780 --> 14:11.680
<i>I-I-I refuse to go through 
something like that again!</i>

14:11.680 --> 14:14.190
<i>Perhaps I should just not attend...</i>

14:14.190 --> 14:17.410
<i>No, toss that timid attitude away!</i>

14:17.960 --> 14:22.790
Princess Rafina, we shall 
be excusing ourselves now.

14:23.160 --> 14:27.060
Of course. I look forward 
to seeing you dance.

14:28.040 --> 14:32.260
<i>The second rule I need 
to follow at the academy:</i>

14:32.260 --> 14:34.600
<i>Develop as many beneficial 
connections as possible</i>

14:34.600 --> 14:37.600
<i>in case the revolution still occurs.</i>

14:38.380 --> 14:43.610
<i>And this ball is indeed the perfect 
opportunity to build connections!</i>

14:44.880 --> 14:48.820
<i>To avoid the guillotine this time, 
I'll take different actions!</i>

14:49.490 --> 14:52.530
Princess Mia, what has come over you?

14:54.860 --> 14:56.960
We're holding a strategy meeting!

14:56.960 --> 14:58.900
Huh? For what?

14:58.900 --> 15:03.790
I wish to arrange the ideal 
way to meet a gentleman.

15:04.700 --> 15:10.340
For that purpose, I shall need you to 
mobilize all your knowledge of romance, Anne!

15:13.480 --> 15:17.560
The faint love the princess held for Ludwig

15:17.560 --> 15:21.840
has been put away as a hidden 
feeling stored in her heart.

15:23.160 --> 15:25.030
Then does she have a new love?

15:25.030 --> 15:28.580
She must! It must have 
blossomed here on campus!

15:28.580 --> 15:29.710
How wonderful!

15:29.710 --> 15:30.830
Oh, my!

15:30.830 --> 15:32.110
I'm so happy!

15:32.110 --> 15:34.180
Understood, Princess Mia.

15:34.180 --> 15:39.890
I, Anne, humbly pledge to squeeze out 
every ounce of knowledge I have for you.

15:39.890 --> 15:42.420
Let's devise the perfect romance strategy!

15:49.840 --> 15:53.970
<i>According to Anne's investigations, 
it should be any moment now.</i>

15:56.510 --> 15:59.140
<i>There he is! Prince Abel!</i>

15:59.390 --> 16:04.600
<i>Abel Remno. A classmate of Mia's and 
second prince of the Kingdom of Remno,</i>

16:04.600 --> 16:08.610
<i>a nation with particularly 
developed military strength.</i>

16:09.120 --> 16:13.200
<i>Mia had set her sights on him since 
before arriving at the academy.</i>

16:13.200 --> 16:18.070
<i>The easiest people to marry into the 
empire are second princes or lower.</i>

16:18.070 --> 16:20.800
<i>People unlikely to succeed to a throne.</i>

16:20.790 --> 16:39.060
Kingdom of Sunkland

16:20.790 --> 16:39.060
Holy Principality of Belluga

16:20.790 --> 16:39.060
Tearmoon Empire

16:20.790 --> 16:39.060
Kingdom of Remno

16:20.800 --> 16:25.890
<i>Plus, Remno is on opposite side of Sunkland.</i>

16:25.890 --> 16:29.840
<i>If I develop a romantic 
relationship with Prince Abel,</i>

16:29.840 --> 16:36.130
<i>then, should Sunkland attack, I can request 
 reinforcements and execute pincer attacks!</i>

16:36.130 --> 16:39.060
<i>Mia was stable in her Mia-first philosophy.</i>

16:40.880 --> 16:43.200
<i>Prepare yourself, Prince Abel!</i>

16:43.200 --> 16:46.480
<i>I'm about to hit you with 
the perfect meet cute!</i>

16:47.040 --> 16:49.980
There is only one strategy we need to employ.

16:52.540 --> 16:53.450
<i>Now!</i>

16:55.310 --> 16:57.370
The handkerchief drop operation!

17:00.480 --> 17:02.620
<i>I did it, Anne!</i>

17:03.040 --> 17:07.450
Once the gentleman you wish to 
approach picks up your handkerchief,

17:07.450 --> 17:11.000
you thank him and then casually 
ask his plans for the dance.

17:11.000 --> 17:14.580
Then, if it appears he has yet to 
make arrangements with anyone...

17:14.580 --> 17:19.260
all it should take is one Mia smile, 
and then most likely—no, definitely...

17:19.260 --> 17:22.720
Princess, would you dance with me?

17:22.720 --> 17:24.480
It'll go just like this!

17:24.690 --> 17:28.420
<i>What a fantastic, detailed plan, Anne!</i>

17:28.420 --> 17:31.940
<i>Just like a tactician with command 
over the entire imperial military.</i>

17:32.400 --> 17:34.870
<i>Now I just wait for him to address me!</i>

17:41.870 --> 17:45.090
<i>Wh-Wh-Why hasn't he
 picked up my handkerchief?!</i>

17:45.090 --> 17:47.330
<i>Where did Prince Abel go?</i>

17:49.030 --> 17:51.040
Is something troubling you, My Lady?

17:51.830 --> 17:53.610
<i>H-How could I forget</i>

17:53.610 --> 17:57.250
<i>that he was a tremendous flirt?!</i>

17:57.250 --> 18:00.080
<i>If he spots a handkerchief 
and a girl at the same time,</i>

18:00.080 --> 18:02.740
<i>he'll go straight for the girl.</i>

18:02.740 --> 18:07.250
<i>A pretty face, but shallow and
frivolous. That is Abel Remno.</i>

18:11.340 --> 18:12.940
Did someone lose this?

18:14.920 --> 18:17.000
<i>P-P-Prince Sion?!</i>

18:17.000 --> 18:20.480
<i>Why is it him of all 
people who picked it up?!</i>

18:20.480 --> 18:23.330
Excuse me! Did anyone 
here lose a handkerchief?

18:23.330 --> 18:24.100
<i>Not good. Not good.</i>

18:24.100 --> 18:27.120
<i>I absolutely cannot have him 
learn that it's my handkerchief!</i>

18:27.120 --> 18:29.120
Oh, that belongs to Princess Mia.

18:29.120 --> 18:31.040
<i>Tiona!</i>

18:31.480 --> 18:35.760
I borrowed one just like it from 
her yesterday, so I'm certain.

18:36.140 --> 18:38.080
<i>This is s-s-so bad!</i>

18:38.080 --> 18:41.040
<i>It's the pair I absolutely 
can't interact with!</i>

18:41.040 --> 18:42.640
<i>Absolutely not!</i>

18:43.280 --> 18:45.350
Oh, there's Princess Mia.

18:47.970 --> 18:50.150
Princess Mia, you dropped this.

18:50.610 --> 18:55.080
Oh, goodness me. I must have 
accidentally dropped it.

18:55.080 --> 18:57.900
Thank you so very much for telling me.

18:59.690 --> 19:01.520
It is a pleasure to meet you.

19:01.520 --> 19:05.160
I'm Sion Sol Sunkland,
 Prince of the Kingdom of Sunkland.

19:05.840 --> 19:08.870
I have heard much about you, 
Your Imperial Highness Princess Mia.

19:09.220 --> 19:11.450
How very courteous.

19:11.450 --> 19:13.840
Mia Luna Tearmoon.

19:14.430 --> 19:16.400
Now then, if you'll excuse me...

19:16.400 --> 19:18.460
This is actually perfect timing.

19:18.460 --> 19:22.680
Pardon me, Your Highness, but might I ask if 
you have a partner for the dance tomorrow?

19:23.180 --> 19:26.640
If not, I would gladly offer 
myself as a candidate.

19:26.980 --> 19:30.570
<i>How... Why is this happening?!</i>

19:30.570 --> 19:33.680
<i>If I become his dance partner,</i>

19:33.680 --> 19:37.250
<i>then I'll be the most involved 
with him I could possibly be!</i>

19:37.250 --> 19:40.650
<i>Then if I make a mistake later...</i>

19:41.690 --> 19:44.410
<i>No, thank you!</i>

19:44.750 --> 19:50.180
<i>But if I decline his offer, 
then I may hurt his feelings,</i>

19:50.180 --> 19:54.420
<i>and I'll be "that princess 
who turned Shion down."</i>

19:54.420 --> 19:58.880
<i>No one will be brave and 
commendable enough to ask me then.</i>

19:59.840 --> 20:01.340
<i>What do I do?!</i>

20:01.590 --> 20:03.800
Abel. Come with me.

20:07.100 --> 20:07.960
That's...

20:07.960 --> 20:09.330
<i>I spy...</i>

20:09.330 --> 20:11.230
Please excuse me for a moment.

20:12.120 --> 20:14.230
<i>...a chance to escape!</i>

20:17.900 --> 20:19.300
Brother...

20:20.540 --> 20:23.700
Abel, what the hell are you doing?

20:24.430 --> 20:27.490
I was just finding a dance partner—

20:29.280 --> 20:31.720
<i>What a barbaric individual.</i>

20:31.720 --> 20:34.820
As a member of the proud 
royal house of Remno,

20:34.820 --> 20:37.020
you should concentrate
on your swordsmanship.

20:37.020 --> 20:39.470
Then women will approach you instead.

20:41.010 --> 20:46.270
Though I suppose a loser like you still 
wouldn't draw in a decent woman.

20:48.680 --> 20:50.640
What is going on over here?

20:51.810 --> 20:53.210
Who're you?

20:53.800 --> 20:57.770
No need to worry.
 This is just a brotherly quarrel, little missy.

20:58.160 --> 21:02.740
So be a good girl and go away. Get me?

21:03.280 --> 21:07.020
Oh, did I scare you? My bad. My bad.

21:09.000 --> 21:10.940
<i>How childish!</i>

21:10.940 --> 21:15.680
<i>I've had the bloodthirst of a 
revolutionary army directed at me.</i>

21:15.680 --> 21:18.540
<i>This level of conflict is 
like dealing with a kitten.</i>

21:18.540 --> 21:21.780
<i>I'm not dealing with anything 
more than a sheltered prince.</i>

21:21.780 --> 21:23.760
Wh-What's so funny, huh?

21:24.250 --> 21:25.680
Pardon me.

21:25.680 --> 21:32.240
But I simply cannot have you punching 
my dance partner in the face.

21:35.600 --> 21:38.590
If you hadn't forgotten you 
had already asked me to dance

21:38.590 --> 21:44.970
and tried to chat up another girl,
 this would not have happened, Prince Abel.

21:48.400 --> 21:53.370
A pleasure to make your acquaintance, 
First Prince of Remno.

21:53.370 --> 21:57.870
I am Mia Luna Tearmoon, 
Imperial Princess of the Tearmoon Empire.

21:59.820 --> 22:04.880
I was drawn to your brother, 
so I must not be a decent woman.

23:34.890 --> 23:39.890
Illustration by: Ataka
